    "Find subtle bugs requiring deep analysis.\\n\\n" +
    "## Process\\n" +
    "Run 'git diff " + scope.diffBase + "...HEAD' \xB7 Read full files \xB7 Grep callers of modified functions \xB7 Trace callees \xB7 Trace data flow\\n\\n" +
